# TTP-2026-0514 — Setuid Rootshell Staged, Seen on the Linux Syslog Feed
# XQL paste-buffer generated by detection_scanner/scripts/export_artifacts.py

## VALIDATION — Setuid Permission Change on a File in a Writable Path
# purpose: validation
# dataset: linux_syslog

dataset = linux_syslog
| filter message contains "setuid" and (message contains "/tmp/" or message contains "uid=0")
| comp count() as c by host, message
| filter c >= 1

